[
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0588",
    "en": " Huh... What should I do?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hein... Qu'est-ce que je fais?(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0589",
    "en": "   Is that so!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Ah bon!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0590",
    "en": "What a weird human...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Quel humain bizarre...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0591",
    "en": "  You won't do anything painful, right...?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Tu vas pas me faire mal, hein...?(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0592",
    "en": "   Huh? Is that really true...?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hein? C'est bien vrai...?(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0593",
    "en": "   Huh? Me? Well, who knows?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hein? Moi? Qui sait?(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0594",
    "en": "  Hmmm... I feel like there's something{SAUT}else at work here...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hmmm... J'ai l'impression qu'il y a{SAUT}autre chose là-dessous...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0595",
    "en": " Hmph! I hate you too!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Pff! Moi aussi, je te déteste!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0596",
    "en": "  Is there an obstacle in the way of our{SAUT}love? Ahaha... I've always wanted to{SAUT}say that!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Un obstacle se dresse-t-il sur la route{SAUT}de notre amour? Ahaha... J'ai toujours{SAUT}rêvé de dire ça!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0597",
    "en": "  Oh, I'm sorry... I'm okay now.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Oh, pardon... Ça va mieux, maintenant.(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0598",
    "en": " Nooooo! I'm scaaared!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Nooooon! J'ai peuuuur!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0599",
    "en": "  A-Ahahaha...!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "A-Ahahaha...!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0600",
    "en": "  Where's that confidence coming from?{SAUT}Then again, it's better that than a man{SAUT}who has no confidence at all.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "D'où te vient cette assurance?{SAUT}Remarque, ça vaut mieux qu'un homme{SAUT}sans aucune confiance en lui.(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0601",
    "en": " You think so too? You understand!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Tu trouves aussi? Tu me comprends!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0602",
    "en": "  Sheesh! You don't have to get so angry!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Pfff! T'as pas à t'énerver comme ça!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0603",
    "en": "Hey! You got my hopes up!(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Hé! Tu m'as donné de faux espoirs!(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0604",
    "en": "  Oh, my! What should I do?(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "Oh, là là! Qu'est-ce que je fais?(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0605",
    "en": "  A-A secret...? I've got a really bad{SAUT}feeling about this...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "U-Un secret...? J'ai un très mauvais{SAUT}pressentiment...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:text:0606",
    "en": " A-A secret...? I've got a really bad{SAUT}feeling about this...(*RESPONSE*)",
    "fr": "U-Un secret...? J'ai un très mauvais{SAUT}pressentiment...(*RESPONSE*)"
  },
  {
    "id": "YOUEN.BIN:resp:0041",
    "en": "Heheh, that's right.(*RESPONSE*)   ",
    "fr": "Héhé, c'est ça.(*RESPONSE*)",
    "_occurrences": 2
  },
  {
